=== layout: one-panel
# Squash dihybrid cross: before epistasis
@body

| Genotype class | F2 count / 16 | Phenotype |
| --- | --- | --- |
| W\_Y\_ | 9 | Dominant W; dominant Y |
| W\_yy | 3 | Dominant W; recessive y |
| wwY\_ | 3 | Recessive w; dominant Y |
| wwyy | 1 | Recessive for both |

=== layout: two-panels
# Squash Epistasis
@left

- Which genotypes are [white]{color=gray}, [green]{color=green}, and [yellow]{color=orange}?
- What is the phenotypic ratio?
- Figure it out with your neighbors...
@right

- 1. Plants with genotype ww produce enzyme-1, which converts [white]{color=gray} into [green]{color=green}
  - Dominant allele W inhibits conversion to [green]{color=green}
- 2. Plants with genotype Y- produce enzyme-2, which converts [green]{color=green} into [yellow]{color=orange}
  - genotype yy do not encode a functional enzyme-2

