=== layout: one-panel

# Recessive Epistasis

@body

- Labrador coat: two genes
- B\_: black; bb: brown
- E\_: pigment expressed; ee: yellow
- ee masks the B-gene phenotype
- Adjust the usual 9:3:3:1 ratio

=== layout: one-panel

# Recessive Epistasis

@body

- Labrador coat: two genes
- B\_: black; bb: [brown]{color=orange}
- E\_: pigment expressed; ee: yellow
- ee masks the B-gene phenotype
- Merge both ee classes: 9:3:4

=== layout: two-panels
# Recessive epistasis: BbEe x BbEe
@left

- Gametes: BE, Be, bE, be
- Each gamete: probability 1/4
- B\_E\_: black (9/16)
- bbE\_: brown (3/16)
- \_\_ee: yellow (4/16)
- Phenotypic ratio: 9 : 3 : 4
@right

| Egg / sperm | BE | Be | bE | be |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| BE | BBEE | BBEe | BbEE | BbEe |
| Be | BBEe | BBee | BbEe | Bbee |
| bE | BbEE | BbEe | bbEE | bbEe |
| be | BbEe | Bbee | bbEe | bbee |

