- 1\:1\:1\:1 &rarr; (1+1)\:1\:1 &rarr; [2\:1\:1]{color=green}
- [Duplicate Interaction]{color=red}
- 9\:3\:3\:1 &rarr; 9\:(3+3)\:1 &rarr; 9\:6\:1
- 1\:1\:1\:1 &rarr; 1\:(1+1)\:1 &rarr; [1\:2\:1]{color=green}
@right

- [Recessive Epistasis v1]{color=red}
- 9\:3\:3\:1 &rarr; 9\:3\:(3+1) &rarr; 9\:3\:4
- 1\:1\:1\:1 &rarr; 1\:1\:(1+1) &rarr; [1\:1\:2]{color=green}
- [Recessive Epistasis v2]{color=red}
- 9\:3\:3\:1 &rarr; 9\:(3+1)\:3 &rarr; 9\:4\:3
- 1\:1\:1\:1 &rarr; 1\:(1+1)\:1 &rarr; [1\:2\:1]{color=green}
- [Duplicate Dominant Epistasis]{color=red}
- 9\:3\:3\:1 &rarr; (9+3+3)\:1 &rarr; 15\:1
- 1\:1\:1\:1 &rarr; (1+1+1)\:1 &rarr; [3\:1]{color=green}

=== layout: one-panel
# Test-Cross with Epistasis
@body

- Normal test-cross produces [1\:1\:1\:1]{color=red} phenotype ratio formerly 9\:3\:3\:1
- Summer squash test-cross produces [2\:1\:1]{color=red} phenotype ratio formerly 12\:3\:1
- Labrador retriever test-cross produces [1\:1\:2]{color=red} phenotype ratio formerly 9\:3\:4
- Pea flower test-cross produces [1\:3]{color=red} phenotype ratio formerly 9\:7

